---
/*
  Page header: the one h1 and a sentence on what the archive holds. The sentence describes the
  section (Master Brief P2); it makes no claim about any event.
*/
---

<header class="intro">
  <div class="page-narrow flow">
    <p class="type-meta kicker">Events</p>
    <h1 class="type-display">Events &amp; Initiatives Archive</h1>
    <p class="type-lead measure">
      Upcoming events first, then the archive of past events, with the photos, recaps, slides and
      code repositories that exist for each.
    </p>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .intro {
    padding-block: var(--space-7) var(--space-section);
  }
  .kicker {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .intro :global(.flow) {
    --flow-space: var(--space-4);
  }
</style>
